WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.498
"Somebody stole Mr. Wig's money," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:05.499 --> 00:00:08.555
"I need to get to his house right away!"

3
00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:11.420
Roxy's friends were coming back toward her.

4
00:00:11.421 --> 00:00:13.810
They didn't look happy.

5
00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:18.137
"That guy didn't want any candy bars either," said Jack.

6
00:00:18.138 --> 00:00:21.231
"You know what?" said Roxy.

7
00:00:21.232 --> 00:00:24.193
"I think we skipped some houses.

8
00:00:24.194 --> 00:00:27.098
I'll go back to them."

9
00:00:27.099 --> 00:00:29.247
Roxy ran off.

10
00:00:29.248 --> 00:00:31.497
Terrell scratched his head.

11
00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:34.244
"We didn't skip any houses."

12
00:00:34.245 --> 00:00:36.292
Mara pointed to the sky.

13
00:00:36.293 --> 00:00:42.461
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

14
00:00:42.462 --> 00:00:45.870
A moment later Roxy arrived at Mr. Wig's house.

15
00:00:45.871 --> 00:00:50.409
Detective Smith was climbing into the safe.

16
00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:58.466
Roxy smiled. "I doubt the robber is still in there, Detective."

17
00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:03.433
"Very funny." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

18
00:01:03.434 --> 00:01:05.417
"I know the robber isn't in here.

19
00:01:05.418 --> 00:01:07.451
I'm looking for clues."

20
00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:09.984
Mr. Wig frowned at Roxy.

21
00:01:09.985 --> 00:01:13.352
"I can't believe you're making jokes!

22
00:01:13.353 --> 00:01:16.380
My money was stolen!"

23
00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:20.132
"Don't worry, Mr. Wig," said Detective Smith.

24
00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:22.202
He stood back up.

25
00:01:22.203 --> 00:01:25.196
"We'll find the thief and get your money back.

26
00:01:25.197 --> 00:01:28.338
Rocket Girl has lots of super powers."

27
00:01:28.339 --> 00:01:33.748
"Yes, I know about Rocket Girl's super powers," said Mr. Wig.

28
00:01:33.749 --> 00:01:35.284
He looked at Roxy.

29
00:01:35.285 --> 00:01:37.317
"You can fly, right?"

30
00:01:37.318 --> 00:01:39.199
"Yep!" said Roxy.

31
00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.609
"Well, so can I," said Mr. Wig.

32
00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:47.206
"Because I have my very own jet."

33
00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:49.889
"Big deal," said Roxy.

34
00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:53.153
"I can shoot lasers from my eyes.

35
00:01:53.154 --> 00:01:55.932
And I can see through walls."

36
00:01:55.933 --> 00:01:58.979
"Hmph!" Mr. Wig folded his arms.

37
00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:02.443
"I'm one of the richest people in Metro City."

38
00:02:02.444 --> 00:02:04.630
Roxy folded her arms.

39
00:02:04.631 --> 00:02:07.532
"I can lift a truck."

40
00:02:07.533 --> 00:02:13.734
Mr. Wig shrugged. "Just find my money, please."

41
00:02:13.735 --> 00:02:17.026
Roxy and Detective Smith went outside.

42
00:02:17.027 --> 00:02:20.932
"I do not like that man," said Roxy.

43
00:02:20.933 --> 00:02:25.145
"Let's just try to solve this case," said Detective Smith.

44
00:02:25.146 --> 00:02:28.212
"Mr. Wig said he heard a buzzing sound.

45
00:02:28.213 --> 00:02:31.261
And there were spider webs in his bedroom."

46
00:02:31.262 --> 00:02:33.207
Roxy looked thoughtful.

47
00:02:33.208 --> 00:02:37.219
"Maybe bugs robbed Mr. Wig."

48
00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:41.373
"Ha-ha," said Detective Smith, pretending to laugh again.

49
00:02:41.374 --> 00:02:45.249
"No, I'm serious," said Roxy.

50
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:48.030
"Remember the villain Von Buzz?

51
00:02:48.031 --> 00:02:51.354
He trained bugs to steal things."

52
00:02:51.355 --> 00:02:53.688
Detective Smith shook his head.

53
00:02:53.689 --> 00:02:57.234
"It can't be Von Buzz. He's in jail."

54
00:02:57.235 --> 00:03:00.690
"He was in jail," said Roxy.

55
00:03:00.691 --> 00:03:03.982
"But he got out two weeks ago."

56
00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:07.172
"You're right!" said Detective Smith.

57
00:03:07.173 --> 00:03:09.205
"I forgot about that."

58
00:03:09.206 --> 00:03:13.821
"Maybe Von Buzz started robbing people again," said Roxy.

59
00:03:13.822 --> 00:03:18.557
Just then Detective Smith's phone rang.

60
00:03:18.558 --> 00:03:21.052
"Yes?" said the detective.

61
00:03:21.053 --> 00:03:23.987
"Really? We'll be right there!"

62
00:03:23.988 --> 00:03:25.707
He hung up the phone.

63
00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:29.192
"Someone just broke into Mrs. Bun's house.

64
00:03:29.193 --> 00:03:31.532
She lives on this street too."

65
00:03:31.533 --> 00:03:33.554
He turned back to Roxy.

66
00:03:33.555 --> 00:03:41.157
"Let's . . . Rocket Girl?"

